{"id":"n70394-2-5","stage":4,"title":"우르르 · 扑噜扑噜","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70394-2-5-1","ko":"엄마! 주전자의 물이 우르르 끓어요.","zh":"妈妈！水壶里的水正在“咕嘟咕嘟”地烧开呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마!","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주전자의","meaning":"壶","explanation":"주전자：壶；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"주전자","audio":"/audio/5d3d873a50897a89ff4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25982","senseId":"1","lemma":"주전자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물이","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우르르","meaning":"扑噜扑噜","explanation":"우르르：扑噜扑噜","readings":[{"term":"우르르","audio":"/audio/f3bad8b8b0838317c67f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70394","senseId":"2","lemma":"우르르","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끓어요.","meaning":"沸腾，开","explanation":"끓다：沸腾，开；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"끓다","audio":"/audio/9cc2edb7c58868d6db66.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62282","senseId":"1","lemma":"끓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"5d3d873a50897a89","term":"주전자","zh":"壶","audio":"/audio/5d3d873a50897a89ff4f.mp3","entryId":"25982","definition":"一种盛水、酒而煮或可把这些东西等倒在杯子里的，有把有嘴的器具。","pronunciation":["주전자"]},{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"含在河、湖、海、地下水等，纯粹的且无色无香无味的透明液体。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"f3bad8b8b0838317","term":"우르르","zh":"扑噜扑噜","audio":"/audio/f3bad8b8b0838317c67f.mp3","entryId":"70394","definition":"液体突然煮开或潽出来的声音；或指其模样。","pronunciation":["우르르"]},{"id":"9cc2edb7c58868d6","term":"끓다","zh":"沸腾，开","audio":"/audio/9cc2edb7c58868d6db66.mp3","entryId":"62282","definition":"液体滚烫，冒出气泡。","pronunciation":["끌타"]}],"audio":"/audio/2173785e17290a425a2b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70394-2-5-2","ko":"그래? 그럼 가스레인지를 꺼 놓으렴.","zh":"是吗？那快把燃气灶关掉吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"그래：真的","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가스레인지를","meaning":"煤气灶","explanation":"가스레인지：煤气灶；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"가스레인지","audio":"/audio/6417b4aff13b3319e6bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14639","senseId":"1","lemma":"가스레인지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꺼","meaning":"关","explanation":"끄다：关；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"끄다","audio":"/audio/1e0c0d787abf4da9e67d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73443","senseId":"2","lemma":"끄다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놓으렴.","meaning":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","explanation":"놓다：表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。；으렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72578","senseId":"1","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于对对方所说的话表示感叹或轻微的惊讶。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"6417b4aff13b3319","term":"가스레인지","zh":"煤气灶","audio":"/audio/6417b4aff13b3319e6bf.mp3","entryId":"14639","definition":"将煤气作为燃料，加热和蒸煮食物的器具。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"1e0c0d787abf4da9","term":"끄다","zh":"关","audio":"/audio/1e0c0d787abf4da9e67d.mp3","entryId":"73443","definition":"切断电流或机器运转动力的路径，使其停止运行。","pronunciation":["끄다"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"72578","definition":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","pronunciation":["노타"]}],"audio":"/audio/9a57ae430cb1393e46d5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.58,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70394","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":128,"sequenceScore":2.4067,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是吗？那快把燃气灶关掉吧。","今天的月亮格外明亮啊。","妈妈！水壶里的水正在“咕嘟咕嘟”地烧开呢。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是吗？那快把燃气灶关掉吧。","妈妈！水壶里的水正在“咕嘟咕嘟”地烧开呢。","今天的月亮格外明亮啊。"],"answer":0}]}
